        "content": "START HEALTH 9 — MOVE 2 — MELEE.\nWhen Elektra Resurrects: Flip your health dial (set Elektra to 9). Shuffle your discard pile into your deck.\nPlace Elektra and all Hand back onto the board with each fighter in a different zone.\n✋ You must resolve effects with this symbol."
